{'symbol': 'HIG', 'date': '2022-09-09 09:05:00', 'title': 'THE HARTFORD EXPANDS MEDICAL PROVIDER TRAINING ON ADDICTION, PAIN MANAGEMENT AND STIGMA', 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ADDICTION--THE HARTFORD, A LEADING WORKERS' COMPENSATION AND DISABILITY INSURER, IS EXTENDING ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH THE YALE PROGRAM IN ADDICTION MEDICINE (YALE-PAM) TO PROVIDE A NEWLY-DEVELOPED TRAINING ON ADDICTION, PAIN MANAGEMENT AND STIGMA TO MORE MEDICAL PROVIDERS WHO TREAT INJURED WORKERS. “SCIENCE AND EMPATHY ARE BOTH CRITICAL TO ADDRESSING THE ONGOING OPIOID CRISIS, AND THE UNIQUE TRAINING DEVELOPED AS PART OF OUR PARTNERSHIP HAS BOTH,” SAID THE HARTFORD'S CHAIRMA"}